msgid ""
"It looks like you declined to grant us permission to access your "
"information. We understand and value your privacy. We ask for this "
"information so we can contact you with your ballot tracking number and when "
"an election in which you participated has been tallied. We will not use this"
" information for any other purpose. Without it, we cannot complete the "
"voting process."
msgstr ""
"Parece que rexeitaches darnos permiso para acceder á túa información. "
"Entendémolo e respectamos a túa privacidade. Pedimos esta información para "
"poder enviarche o código de seguimento da túa papeleta e avisarte cando se "
"complete o escrutinio dunha elección na que participaches. Non empregaremos "
"esta información para ningún outro fin. Sen ela non podemos completar o "
"proceso de votación."

